   g. Git readiness: stage the intended files, create the submission commit, verify `git -C {{.Worktree}} status --short` is clean, then capture the full submission SHA as directed in TOOLS.
   h. Submission proof: `{{binaryName}} submit-for-review` must actually run successfully after step 9g; do not treat the arch doc plus `{{binaryName}} set-task-output` as sufficient.
10. Submit using {{binaryName}} submit-for-review --json only after all checks in step 9 pass, using the captured full SHA.
